  triage:title "BB.5's task-send ack-contract change (70adbf12d) broke 19 pre-existing tests asserting the old contract" ;
  triage:description "fenix, FYI relayed at stack-collapse time (message 01M2BV5FMEMVVYX7M8KD5WF8MK, 2026-09-12T22:24:22Z): BB.5 (70adbf12d) changed the task-send ack contract and left 19 tests asserting the old one, across atm-core (nudge_mode, task_reminder_dispatch, task_state) and atm-http-runtime (herdr_queue_wake). 4 were fixed as part of the stack collapse; 15 remained outstanding, root cause of red CI on the collapsed stack's layers alongside BB3-023. team-lead independently observed 4 of the 15 (nudge_mode.rs:561,590,780,874: actual_dispatch_matrix_covers_tmux_and_herdr_members, sync_and_async_graft_task_writes_use_the_queue_dispatch_kind, task_tagged_async_prepare_forces_deferred_mode, task_tagged_sync_prepare_forces_deferred_mode) failing in PR #1452's Test (ubuntu-latest) job 103631559165 with 'assertion left == right failed' panics, consistent with an unmigrated ack-contract assertion." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-bb" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "test-coverage" ;
  triage:severity "blocking" ;
  triage:source "fenix (stack-collapse root-cause analysis)" ;
  triage:repeatable true ;
  triage:sweepScope "crates/atm-core/tests/nudge_mode.rs; task_reminder_dispatch; task_state; crates/atm-http-runtime herdr_queue_wake" ;
  triage:status "open" ;
  triage:dispatchReady false ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-09-12T22:24:22Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:deferredNote "Fix: migrate the 15 remaining test assertions to BB.5's new ack contract. Fixed by fenix on fix/bb5-contract-tests @ d1969185f (PR #1456, stack: #1452 feature/bb-collapsed (frozen) -> #1456 fix/bb5-contract-tests -> #1453 fix/bb5-closure-r1 -> #1455 fix/bb3-qa3-r4); 15 contract tests fixed, just lint 36/36, just test green. Fixed-pending-QA; not routed further, fenix owns this layer." ;
  triage:foundIn triage:BB5 ;
